  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: (1st Number + 2nd Number) × 8 = 3rd number.\n\nGiven,\n\n(22, 49, 568)\n\n⇒ (22 + 49) × 8 \n\n⇒ 71 × 8 = 568.\n\nAnd, (25, 45, 560)\n\n⇒ (25 + 45) × 8​\n\n⇒ 70 × 8 = 560.\n\nNow, checking the options:\n\nOption 1) (30, 15, 225)\n\n⇒ (30 + 15) × 8\n\n⇒ 45 × 8 = 360 ≠ 225.\n\nOption 2) (15, 33, 240)\n\n⇒ (15 + 33) × 8\n\n⇒ 48 × 8 = 384 ≠ 240.\n\n**Option 3) (33, 38, 568)**\n\n**⇒ (33 + 38) × 8**\n\n**⇒ 71 × 8 = 568 = 568.**\n\nOption 4) (18, 27, 225)\n\n⇒ (18 + 27) × 8\n\n⇒ 45 × 8 = 360 ≠ 225\n\n Hence, the correct option is \"Option 3\".",
